      ],
      "source": "https://www.okhistory.org/publications/enc/entry?entry=SE022"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Sequoyah County straddles the Ozark Plateau in the north and the Ouachita Mountains region in the south.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.okhistory.org/publications/enc/entry?entry=SE022"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Arkansas River forms the southern border of Sequoyah County, creating a landscape of bayous, sloughs, and bottoms.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        29
