      ],
      "source": "https://www.okhistory.org/publications/enc/entry?entry=SE022"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The first railroad arrived in Sequoyah County between 1888 and 1890 via the Kansas and Arkansas Valley Railway.",
